{"seq":1,"slug":"ranking-regression-gate","title":"排序版本回归门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-offline-eval-platform/regression-baseline/ranking-regression-gate","wordCount":2944,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"排序版本回归门禁\">排序版本回归门禁</h1><p>门禁是离线评测体系里唯一会<strong>否决</strong>的组件。前面三章建立的所有能力——可信的标注集、正确的指标、校正过的偏差——如果不接上一条自动执行、判定明确的规则，它们就只是报告，而报告不会阻止任何一次有问题的发版。搜索排序的发版频率通常是周级甚至日级，靠人在每次发版前记得去跑评测、记得去看结果、记得在指标下降时说不，是一件在忙碌时期必然失效的事。门禁把这三个「记得」变成一个不可绕过的检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>门禁的判定逻辑可以写成一个多条件的联合规则。给定候选版本 C 与基线版本 B，门禁需要输出三个结论之一：<strong>通过</strong>、<strong>阻断</strong>、或<strong>转人工</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Verdict</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>通过</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>阻断</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>转人工</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>其余</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Verdict} = \\begin{cases} \\text{通过}, &amp; \\Delta_{main} \\geq \\tau_{up} \\;\\wedge\\; \\forall g: \\Delta_g \\geq -\\tau_g \\\\ \\text{阻断}, &amp; \\Delta_{main} \\leq -\\tau_{down} \\;\\vee\\; \\exists g: \\Delta_g \\leq -\\tau^{hard}_g \\\\ \\text{转人工}, &amp; \\text{其余} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Verdict</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通过</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">阻断</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">转人工</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">main</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">main</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其余</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{main}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">main</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是主指标的差值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{up}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是判定为「显著提升」的阈值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各个守卫指标（多样性、覆盖率、会话级指标等）的差值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是允许的退化容限。</p>\n<p>这个公式体现三条设计原则：<strong>主指标负责方向，守卫指标负责边界，不显著不等于通过</strong>。第三条最容易被忽略——一个差值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0.0004</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+0.0004</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">0.0004</span></span></span></span></span>、置信区间跨越 0 的版本，既不能算提升也不能算退化，把它当作「通过」是门禁形同虚设的最主要方式，因为大量无意义的改动会以这种方式悄悄上线并累积风险。</p>\n<p>下图给出门禁在一次发版流程中的位置与判定分支。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选版本提交] --&gt; B[自动触发全量评测]&#10;  B --&gt; C[计算主指标与守卫指标]&#10;  C --&gt; D{主指标显著提升?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否, 且显著下降| E[阻断]&#10;  D --&gt;|否, 不显著| F[转人工评审]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| G{守卫指标越界?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[阻断或转人工]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[通过, 进入放量流程]\">graph TD\n  A[候选版本提交] --&gt; B[自动触发全量评测]\n  B --&gt; C[计算主指标与守卫指标]\n  C --&gt; D{主指标显著提升?}\n  D --&gt;|否, 且显著下降| E[阻断]\n  D --&gt;|否, 不显著| F[转人工评审]\n  D --&gt;|是| G{守卫指标越界?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[阻断或转人工]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[通过, 进入放量流程]</pre><p>门禁的输入必须包含<strong>基线版本的固定引用</strong>，而不是「上一次跑的结果」。如果基线是可变的，两次运行之间的差异就无法归因——你分不清是候选版本变了还是基线漂移了。基线应当作为评测任务的一个参数被显式记录（<a href=\"eval-platform-automation\">评测平台化与一键对比</a> 的「三版本绑定」）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值的设定方法\">阈值的设定方法</h2><p>阈值是门禁里最容易被拍脑袋决定的部分，而它恰恰是决定门禁是否有意义的地方。正确的做法是<strong>从数据里估计</strong>，而不是从经验里抄。三个必要的估计量如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>估计量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>获得方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标注噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{label}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>评测集本身的重测波动</td>\n<td>用不同标注批次或 bootstrap 重采样重算指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>候选差异分布</td>\n<td>历史版本之间差值的分布</td>\n<td>统计过去 N 次发版的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务可感知最小差异</td>\n<td>业务方认为值得发版的最小收益</td>\n<td>与业务方共同定义，通常来自历史 A/B 的效应量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_{label}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是阈值的地板：任何小于它的阈值都是在噪声里做判定。估计方法有三种，可靠性递增。</p>\n<p>第一种是 <strong>bootstrap 重采样</strong>：对评测集的查询做有放回抽样，重算指标，重复上千次得到标准差。它估计的抽样波动只来自查询样本量，不包含标注本身的噪声。</p>\n<p>第二种是 <strong>多标注批次对照</strong>：如果同一批查询被不同批次标注过（第一章提到的重叠标注），直接比较两批标签算出的指标差值，这个差值就是标注噪声的直接测量。它最准确，但需要额外的标注成本。</p>\n<p>第三种是 <strong>历史不变量重测</strong>：用同一个模型、同一个评测集，在不同时间跑两次，比较结果。若平台有非确定性（随机种子、浮点累加顺序），这个差值同时包含了平台抖动，正好是门禁需要的总波动量。</p>\n<p>实践中的组合是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{up}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(2\\sigma, \\epsilon_{biz})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是上述估计的波动量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon_{biz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是业务可感知最小差异。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 对应的是约 95% 置信度的单侧判定，避免把噪声当提升。</p>\n<p>一个常见的错误是<strong>把阈值设成历史差值的中位数</strong>。这会让一半的历史版本恰好卡在通过线上，看起来「符合历史」，实际上让门禁的通过率由历史版本的运气决定，而不是由质量决定。阈值应当由噪声与业务价值共同决定，与历史通过率无关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多指标冲突的处理\">多指标冲突的处理</h2><p>单个主指标不足以决定通过与否，因为不同的指标对不同的改动方向敏感（已在 <a href=\"../offline-metrics/ndcg-mrr-map\">NDCG/MRR/MAP 指标与选择</a> 讨论）。多指标联合判定时会遇到方向不一致的情况，需要事先规定处置方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>推荐处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NDCG↑ 且 MAP↑</td>\n<td>方向一致，改善广泛</td>\n<td>通过（若无守卫越界）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDCG↑ 但 MAP↓</td>\n<td>顶部改善，召回受损</td>\n<td>转人工，检查是否牺牲多样性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDCG↑ 但业务代理↓</td>\n<td>相关性改善与业务价值脱节</td>\n<td>转人工，触发 <a href=\"../offline-online-consistency/offline-online-gap\">离线-在线指标背离原因</a> 的背离诊断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDCG 持平但 MAP↑</td>\n<td>覆盖改善但未提升顶部</td>\n<td>视业务而定，通常转人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键切片全部↑ 但总指标持平</td>\n<td>结构性改善被稀释</td>\n<td>转人工（这是漏报，见 <a href=\"badcase-regression-set\">badcase 回归集防退化</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四种情形值得说明：<strong>总指标持平但某个关键切片显著提升</strong>，是一个容易被门禁漏掉的有价值改动。如果门禁只看总指标，这个改动会被判定为无差异而转入人工队列，可能被忽略；正确做法是让门禁同时评估<strong>切片级结论</strong>，并对「总指标不降 + 关键切片显著提升」这一类给出正面信号。这与 <a href=\"badcase-regression-set\">badcase 回归集防退化</a> 的 badcase 回归集正好构成互补：回归集防「切片退化被总量掩盖」，切片门禁防「切片改善被总量掩盖」。</p>\n<p>关键切片清单本身需要维护，它通常包括：头部查询、每个主力市场或语言、每个主力品类、以及一份高商业价值的查询集合。切片数量不宜过多，因为每个切片都需要足够的查询数才能得到可信的置信区间（第一章建议的不低于 300 条查询的约束在这里直接生效）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"守卫项与冻结项的区分\">守卫项与冻结项的区分</h2><p>守卫项（guard）与冻结项（frozen）是两类不同强度的约束，混淆它们会让门禁要么过松要么过严。</p>\n<p><strong>守卫项</strong>是允许小幅波动但不能显著退化的指标：多样性、覆盖率、会话级指标、各市场切片的主指标。它们的判定形式是「不显著低于基线超过容限」，容限通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_g = 1\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>冻结项</strong>是不允许任何退化的指标，通常来自历史线上事故的教训：一批曾经导致严重体验问题的查询、一段被明文禁止的排序行为（例如把无库存商品排进前 k）、某些合规约束（例如某市场的广告位置规范）。冻结项的判定是不设容限的，任何下降都阻断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类型</th>\n<th>判定形式</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n<th>谁定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主指标</td>\n<td>显著高于基线</td>\n<td>NDCG@10</td>\n<td>算法团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>守卫项</td>\n<td>不显著低于基线</td>\n<td>多样性、覆盖率、分市场切片</td>\n<td>算法 + 业务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结项</td>\n<td>不得下降</td>\n<td>事故查询集、合规约束</td>\n<td>业务 + 法务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>冻结项的维护成本高（每一条都要有人负责），因此数量应当严格控制在个位数到几十条。把大量指标塞进冻结项会让门禁变成「什么都不许改」，最终被绕过的门禁比没有门禁更糟——因为它给了团队一种虚假的安全感。</p>\n<p>一个与冻结项相关的工程要求是<strong>违规时的可解释性</strong>。当门禁阻断一个版本时，它必须能说出是哪一条冻结项、涉及哪些查询、退化幅度是多少。只说「冻结项未通过」的门禁会让工程师花半天去猜，久而久之他们就会开始要求豁免。可解释性不是锦上添花，它是门禁能被长期执行的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"门禁的失效模式与自我监控\">门禁的失效模式与自我监控</h2><p>门禁本身也会失效，且失效方式往往是静默的。三种最常见的失效模式及其检测方法如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>检测方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阈值漂移</td>\n<td>评测集刷新后阈值未同步更新，门禁过松或过严</td>\n<td>每次评测集版本变更后重算阈值并记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基线腐化</td>\n<td>基线版本本身有已知缺陷，后续版本都在与坏基线比</td>\n<td>定期用「黄金版本」校验基线的绝对水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绕过路径</td>\n<td>存在不经门禁的紧急发版通道且被频繁使用</td>\n<td>统计绕过次数与占比，超过阈值触发审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二条最隐蔽。如果某次发版因为紧急被豁免，之后它成为新基线，那么它的缺陷就变成了「正常水平」，后续版本只要不退到它以下就能通过，而这个缺陷永远不会被修复。对策是保留一份<strong>黄金版本</strong>（长期表现稳定的一个版本）和它的评测记录，定期用它重跑评测，观察绝对分数是否在漂移——若漂移，说明评测集或平台发生了变化，而不是模型变化。</p>\n<p>第三条涉及组织纪律而非技术。紧急通道是必要的（线上事故必须能快速回滚或热修），但它的使用必须被记录和定期审计。一个可用的护栏是：紧急发版后 24 小时内补跑门禁评测并归档结果，若发现它本应被阻断则需要复盘。</p>\n<p>门禁自我监控的最后一项是<strong>通过率的合理性检查</strong>。如果一个门禁的通过率长期是 100%，它没有在起作用；如果长期低于 30%，它大概率过严，团队会开始寻找绕过方式。一个健康的门禁通过率通常在 50%-80% 区间，剩余部分由转人工与阻断构成，且转人工的案件应当有明确的处置记录。这个统计本身应当被当作一个运营指标来跟踪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>门禁的判定是三值输出而非二值：通过、阻断、转人工；把「不显著」当作通过是门禁失效的主要方式。</li>\n<li>阈值必须从噪声与业务价值估计，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{up} \\approx \\max(2\\sigma, \\epsilon_{biz})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 可用 bootstrap、重叠标注批次对照或历史重测三种方式获得。</li>\n<li>阈值不能设成历史差值的中位数，否则通过率由历史运气决定。</li>\n<li>多指标冲突需事先规定处置规则；「总指标持平但关键切片提升」是有价值的信号，门禁应评估切片级结论。</li>\n<li>守卫项有不显著容限，冻结项不允许任何退化；冻结项数量应控制在个位到几十条，且必须可解释。</li>\n<li>门禁自身需要监控：阈值随评测集刷新同步、用黄金版本防止基线腐化、审计紧急绕过通道、跟踪通过率合理性。</li>\n<li>一个长期 100% 通过或长期低于 30% 通过的门禁都需要重新校准。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选版本] --&gt; B[主指标判定]&#10;  A --&gt; C[守卫项判定]&#10;  A --&gt; D[冻结项判定]&#10;  B --&gt; E{联合逻辑}&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[通过]&#10;  E --&gt; G[阻断含原因]&#10;  E --&gt; H[转人工]&#10;  H --&gt; I[处置记录归档]\">graph TD\n  A[候选版本] --&gt; B[主指标判定]\n  A --&gt; C[守卫项判定]\n  A --&gt; D[冻结项判定]\n  B --&gt; E{联合逻辑}\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[通过]\n  E --&gt; G[阻断含原因]\n  E --&gt; H[转人工]\n  H --&gt; I[处置记录归档]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排序版本回归门禁","id":"排序版本回归门禁"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值的设定方法","id":"阈值的设定方法"},{"level":2,"text":"多指标冲突的处理","id":"多指标冲突的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"守卫项与冻结项的区分","id":"守卫项与冻结项的区分"},{"level":2,"text":"门禁的失效模式与自我监控","id":"门禁的失效模式与自我监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"interleaving 预测在线效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-offline-eval-platform/offline-online-consistency/interleaving-predict"},"next":{"title":"badcase 回归集防退化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-offline-eval-platform/regression-baseline/badcase-regression-set"}}